    "prompt": "How many customers are inside A1 and how does it compare to the rest of Texas?\n\nMap annotations drawn by the user (refer to them by id; geojson is [lon, lat], usable with ST_GEOGFROMGEOJSON):\n- A1 \"why so many here?\": Polygon, bbox [-99, 29, -94.7, 33.4], ~146,557 km²\n  geojson: {\"type\":\"Polygon\",\"coordinates\":[[[-97.6,33.4],[-96,33.3],[-94.7,30.2],[-94.9,29.3],[-95.6,29],[-98.9,29],[-99,29.8],[-97.6,33.4]]]}",
